WEBVTT

01:39.020 --> 01:42.740
Neo-Saitama, a land of gray concrete.

01:42.740 --> 01:46.960
Tucked away deep within it lies a verdant BAMBOO thicket untouched by man.

01:49.400 --> 01:54.120
He moves in this strange manner to avoid the hundreds of NARIKO.

01:54.850 --> 01:58.310
NARIKO are dangerous booby traps,

01:58.310 --> 02:00.680
whose secrets are passed down from NINJA to NINJA.

02:03.350 --> 02:04.100
YEEART!

02:07.850 --> 02:09.580
An ambush!

02:11.620 --> 02:14.780
How many points was my ambush worth today?

02:16.940 --> 02:17.950
Yukano.

02:17.950 --> 02:19.740
I'm not your SENSEI.

02:25.710 --> 02:27.740
How is SENSEI's condition?

02:27.740 --> 02:29.510
Not good.

02:29.510 --> 02:31.140
I see.

02:31.140 --> 02:34.820
This is the former master of DRAGON DŌJŌ,

02:34.820 --> 02:37.050
and the man known as the Ancient NINJA

02:37.050 --> 02:39.200
Dragon Gendōsō.

02:39.200 --> 02:40.290
SENSEI.

02:42.020 --> 02:44.200
Is that you, Fujikido?

02:44.200 --> 02:49.600
But he is clearly weakened,
and nears Death's door.

02:49.600 --> 02:55.110
He was struck down by the hateful poison,
the anti-NINJA virus: TAKEUCHI.

02:55.110 --> 02:56.730
Yukano.

02:57.450 --> 02:58.530
Here.

03:00.710 --> 03:03.450
An ampule that Yoroshisan was hiding.

03:03.450 --> 03:05.940
With this, SENSEI is sure to recover.

03:05.940 --> 03:07.410
Fujikido.

03:07.850 --> 03:13.420
Of the dangerous adventures he'd gone on to obtain this holy grail of medicines,

03:13.420 --> 03:15.880
Fujikido spoke not a word.

03:17.110 --> 03:20.140
You were mad to do such a thing.

03:20.140 --> 03:25.370
It was simple. With my iron will,
and the NINJA SOUL within me—

03:25.370 --> 03:27.720
That is why your situation is perilous.

03:28.200 --> 03:32.480
If that NINJA SOUL had not descended upon me then,

03:32.480 --> 03:35.260
being trampled underfoot would have been my fate.

03:35.730 --> 03:38.770
This power was given to me by fate itself.

03:38.770 --> 03:42.820
I will use it to take revenge and slay all evil NINJA!

03:42.820 --> 03:45.320
That is why I was allowed to survive!

03:48.340 --> 03:50.570
I've mixed the antidote into this tea.

03:50.570 --> 03:53.480
Grandfather, I'm sure this will heal you.

03:55.220 --> 03:58.780
Thank you, Fujikido, Yukano.

04:07.250 --> 04:08.680
Yukano, take care of SENSEI!

04:15.650 --> 04:19.290
Oh, no! The BAMBOO thicket around them is burning!

04:28.310 --> 04:29.870
I was followed!

04:39.770 --> 04:42.590
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.830
I am Dark NINJA.

05:10.540 --> 05:12.980
YEEART!

05:13.580 --> 05:14.540
What?

05:14.820 --> 05:16.370
DWAARGH!

05:16.630 --> 05:20.340
Your KARATE cannot overcome my IAIDŌ.

05:20.340 --> 05:22.450
You've gone too far.

05:22.450 --> 05:25.220
You stepped on the tail of a TIGER named SŌKAIYA,

05:25.220 --> 05:28.820
and now I've been sent to kill you.

05:28.820 --> 05:32.220
The boss has decided you're a threat that cannot be ignored.

05:32.220 --> 05:36.190
I'll show you true NINJA IKUSA.

05:37.310 --> 05:39.060
YEEART!

05:39.060 --> 05:41.550
DWAARGH!

05:44.570 --> 05:46.910
This blade's name is BEPPIN.

05:44.570 --> 05:46.910
NOTE: BEPPIN means SEXY NINJA BABE.

05:46.910 --> 05:51.160
Tremble! For you are no match for even the least of my secret techniques!

05:51.160 --> 05:57.420
In the end, you are a failure NINJA who got a few lucky wins against third-stringers.

05:57.420 --> 05:58.750
WASSHOI!

05:59.170 --> 06:01.060
YEEART!

06:04.210 --> 06:05.810
Impudence!

06:06.800 --> 06:07.710
Behind me!?

06:07.710 --> 06:09.010
YEEART!

06:11.600 --> 06:16.080
Viewers, have you studied the history of modern NINJA?

06:16.080 --> 06:17.710
Then you must recognize this.

06:17.710 --> 06:21.770
This is the Dark KARATE technique known as the ALABAMA OTOSHI!

06:21.770 --> 06:25.850
Scholars say a NINJA who fought in the Texas Revolution

06:25.850 --> 06:28.850
independently developed this assassination technique!

06:28.850 --> 06:33.680
He smashed his foes into Alabama's hard clay soil, and killed them all!

06:33.680 --> 06:36.750
This abandoned dark side of history—

06:36.750 --> 06:38.600
DWAAARGHH!

06:40.880 --> 06:42.630
What happened?

06:42.630 --> 06:46.800
If any of you viewers have NINJA KINETIC VISION,

06:42.630 --> 06:46.800
NOTE: This is the ability to see NINJAS.

06:46.800 --> 06:49.340
you surely saw what happened?

06:49.740 --> 06:53.510
Dark NINJA found the hold's weak points,
took control of gravity,

06:53.510 --> 06:56.680
and used the energy from the tailspin to throw his opponent away!

06:57.000 --> 07:00.850
The overwhelming power to defy all known laws of physics.

07:00.850 --> 07:03.310
That is the truth of NINJA IKUSA!

07:03.570 --> 07:06.400
Not even defeating your secret technique will break you?

07:06.710 --> 07:08.530
NINJAS must be slain!

07:10.880 --> 07:12.490
KIRISUTE...

07:14.910 --> 07:16.410
...GOMEN!

07:17.620 --> 07:20.750
DWAAARGHH!

07:21.910 --> 07:23.750
This is the DEATH KIRI.

07:21.910 --> 07:23.750
NOTE: DEATH KIRI means DEADLY FOG.

07:28.710 --> 07:30.300
Now you shall suffer KAISHAKU!

07:30.710 --> 07:33.340
Is this the end?

07:33.340 --> 07:36.640
Is this the end of NINJA Slayer?

07:36.640 --> 07:39.980
That's enough, Dark NINJA-SAN.

07:43.310 --> 07:45.880
DŌMO, Dark NINJA-SAN.

07:45.880 --> 07:47.690
I am Ancient NINJA.

07:49.800 --> 07:52.660
DŌMO, Ancient NINJA-SAN.

07:55.140 --> 07:56.800
I am Dark NINJA.

08:02.710 --> 08:05.250
You survived the attack?

08:06.140 --> 08:08.050
How fortunate.

08:08.340 --> 08:11.570
Now I have another present to take home.

08:11.570 --> 08:16.140
Only NINJA Slayer will survive this battle.

08:18.540 --> 08:21.810
SENSEI intends to die, too!

08:22.810 --> 08:24.690
YEEART!

08:25.920 --> 08:26.770
GWAAARGH!

08:27.110 --> 08:28.320
YEEART!

08:32.400 --> 08:35.220
You can't even defeat a sick old man?

08:35.220 --> 08:36.620
Silence!

08:36.620 --> 08:38.630
KIRISUTE GOMEN!

08:38.630 --> 08:39.600
SENSEI!

08:39.600 --> 08:41.800
YEEART!

08:43.020 --> 08:45.120
GWAAARGH!

08:50.680 --> 08:53.090
Ancient NINJA is dead.

08:56.970 --> 08:58.350
This is the end.

08:59.230 --> 09:01.720
Fuyuko! Tochinoki!

09:18.620 --> 09:20.080
It was you?

09:20.480 --> 09:22.740
You killed my wife and child?

09:22.740 --> 09:23.620
Marunochi...

09:23.620 --> 09:25.340
The Marunochi SUGOI Tall Building?

09:25.340 --> 09:26.290
Oh?

09:26.650 --> 09:30.040
So you're one of the citizens who survived that fight?

09:30.040 --> 09:31.380
I'll kill you!

09:33.800 --> 09:36.130
Kill him! Kill him, Fujikido!

09:36.940 --> 09:41.970
Give me your body,
and I shall give you revenge!

09:42.450 --> 09:44.770
You just lie back and watch.

09:45.570 --> 09:48.190
No! Do not listen to him!

09:49.480 --> 09:50.360
SENSEI!

09:50.710 --> 09:52.170
Indeed!

09:52.170 --> 09:55.510
This is your final INSTRUCTION, Fujikido!

09:55.510 --> 09:58.480
Do not let your NINJA SOUL master you!

09:58.480 --> 10:00.940
You must be the one to hold its reins!

10:00.940 --> 10:02.370
Like this!

10:02.370 --> 10:03.420
YEEART!

10:03.420 --> 10:05.200
UWAAAORGHH!

10:05.200 --> 10:06.330
SENSEI!

10:06.880 --> 10:11.680
Draw out the power of your
NINJA SOUL the right way, Fujikido-SAN!

10:11.680 --> 10:13.770
This is farewell!

10:13.770 --> 10:17.570
Do not ever forget what I have taught you!

10:17.570 --> 10:18.680
And...

10:19.020 --> 10:21.850
Take care of Yukano for me!

10:21.850 --> 10:23.060
SENSEI!

10:24.810 --> 10:26.980
YEEART!

10:25.340 --> 10:26.980
IMPOSSIBLE!

10:26.980 --> 10:28.980
YEEART!

10:28.980 --> 10:30.980
GWAAARGH!

10:31.620 --> 10:32.730
YEEART!

10:33.080 --> 10:34.730
GWAAARGH!

10:35.140 --> 10:36.360
YEEART!

10:36.680 --> 10:38.360
GWAAARGH!

10:38.740 --> 10:40.110
YEEART!

10:40.400 --> 10:42.120
GWAAARGH!

10:42.540 --> 10:43.740
YEEART!

10:44.050 --> 10:45.740
GWAAARGH!

10:46.080 --> 10:47.500
YEEART!

10:47.800 --> 10:49.500
GWAAARGH!

10:49.500 --> 10:51.130
YEEART!

10:51.450 --> 10:53.130
GWAAARGH!

10:53.130 --> 10:54.880
YEEART!

10:55.170 --> 10:56.880
GWAAARGH!

10:57.370 --> 10:58.510
YEEART!

10:58.800 --> 11:00.510
GWAAARGH!

11:01.020 --> 11:02.260
YEEART!

11:02.600 --> 11:04.260
GWAAARGH!

11:04.680 --> 11:06.310
YEEART!

11:08.880 --> 11:11.880
That is not a JIU-JITSU stance!

11:11.880 --> 11:15.180
It is the ancient assassination stance,
the CHADŌ stance!

11:11.880 --> 11:15.180
NOTE: Tea + Zen = CHADŌ

11:16.970 --> 11:18.240
YEEART!

11:18.990 --> 11:21.020
GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH!

11:21.020 --> 11:23.120
YEEART! YEEART! YEEART! YEEART! YEEART! YEEART!

11:23.120 --> 11:23.870
I...

11:23.870 --> 11:24.580
YEEART!

11:24.580 --> 11:25.160
have...

11:25.160 --> 11:25.830
YEEART!

11:25.830 --> 11:26.450
been...

11:26.450 --> 11:27.020
YEEART!

11:27.020 --> 11:29.490
beaten!

11:38.510 --> 11:40.130
SENSEI!

11:51.800 --> 11:54.940
NINJA Slayer had brought forth a hidden power.

11:54.940 --> 11:58.050
But the price he paid was far too great.

11:58.050 --> 12:01.680
Yukano... Was she able to escape?

12:01.680 --> 12:06.580
For now, you must overcome this tragedy and run, NINJA Slayer!
